<title>HONG KONG: Belle Corp launches US$100 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Belle Corp launches US$100 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was</p>
<p>announced by lead manager and bookrunner Deutsche Morgan</p>
<p>Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER BELLE CORP			     GUARANTOR   - -</p>
<p> AMT	US$100 MLN  COUPON    6ML+180    MATURITY    5YRS,1MO</p>
<p> TYPE     FRN	   ISS PRICE PAR	  LAUNCHED    28.FEB.97</p>
<p> PUTS     NONE	  CALLS     NONE	 REPLIES     12.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING  LUXEMBOURG  REPAYMENT BULLET     DENOMS	US$250K</p>
<p> RATINGS  - -	   SALE LMTS - -</p>
<p> NEG PLG  NO	    CRS DEF   YES	  FORCE MAJ   - -</p>
<p> GOV LAW  ENGLISH     HOME CTRY PHILIPPINE TAX PROV    NA</p>
<p>PAY DATE 10.APR.97 TENTATIVE</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES  CO-LEADS  US$10 MLN+ 100 BP ALL-IN 200 BP</p>
<p>			    SNR MGRS  US$5-9 MLN  75 BP ALL-IN 195 BP</p>
<p>			    CO-MGRS   US$2-5 MLN  50 BP ALL-IN 190 BP</p>
<p>ARRANGER  DEUTSCHE MORGAN GRENFELL (BOOKS), HANWHA MERCHANT</p>
<p>	     BANK</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6371</p>
